== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_2_Pets|Tier 2]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Spellhound}}. Increases profits with pet level and passive shards accumulation rate. Yields [[Spells|spell shards]] each second, after charging the ability, depending on level.

Gains [[Experience#Pet_Experience|experience]] with each spell cast.

== Pet Ability ==

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>S \times P \times L^{1.2} \times 0.025 + 1</math>


Charges its ability over:
<br><math>10 - \frac{L}{20}</math>
<br>seconds (minimum 0).

On ability activation, grants spell shards each second, for 10 seconds, equal to:
<br><math>P \times L^{1.25} \times 3.8</math>
<br>If it would give more than <math>10^7</math> shards, it instead gives
<br><math>(P \times L^{1.25} \times 3.8 - 10^7)^{0.25} + 10^7</math>

where:
* <math>S = \text{Spell Shards per Second}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Accrues experience for each shard-based spell cast, equal to:
<br><math>(S + F) \times M</math>

This XP pool is distributed over time, at a rate each second of:
<br><math>1 + \frac{X}{10}</math>

where:
* <math>S = \text{Spell Shard Cost}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>X = \text{Accrued Pet XP}</math>

